Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Joey before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That chump's gonna have to wait,\Ncause we've got bigger problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.15,0:00:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, old chump!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get down to business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, pal, I want Mai back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I led you here to get rid of you for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause Mai can't be happy with you around!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to teach you\Na lesson Joey Wheeler style.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be sorry you've\Never messed with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see what my\Ndeck of armor can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can outrun them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I already tried that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing dangerous\Nabout a bunch of holograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's shut them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tobias, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Fang of Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're putting me to sleep, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make a move so I\Ncan continue to torture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that's going\Nto be in a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And it all starts with this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My Marauding Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm playing him in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my captain's special ability,\NI get to summon another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,to the field And I choose this bad\Nboy My battle warrior in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'll use my Marauding Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Target his life points
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, battle warrior, it's your turn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than that\Nto keep me down. Yeah, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the minor leagues,\Nmate. This duel's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this guy so confident about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even have\None monster on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can do any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.49,0:03:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That helmet thing already\Nwent to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever heard\Nof a special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When psychic armor head's in my graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can automatically bring\Nit back to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But my psychic armor\Nhead should be the least
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of your worries if you\Nknow what I'm getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like you're\Nstarting to catch on, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the seal of Ori Kulkos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's activating the sacred seal,\Nand I have a feeling I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And that loser better leave\Na piece of Wheeler for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my armor head gets a nice power boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate the magic\Ncard, Full Armour Gravitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This little number lets me\Ndraw ten cards from my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and if any are armour cards, I\Nget to summon them right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,More armour cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'll summon Burning Knuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play Jet Gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, it's Overboost, Active Guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,buster knuckle and advanced\Nshield let me guess you're putting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,on another funky space suit\Nyou're smaller than you look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,last time he strapped on that armor he\Nblew away almost half my life points
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M INVINCIBLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent's life points, 2100.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Marauding captain, strength, 1200.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle warrior, strength, 700.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna attack or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This suit of armor is even\Nstronger than the last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But each piece of his little\Ncostume only has 500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to calculate your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Target identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.03,0:06:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Suggested offense, Buster Knuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Probability of success, 99%.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Buster Knuckle gets 200 attack points\Nfor every armor card I have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,For a grand total of 1,900.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much for you, is it\Nnot? Even close I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,through much worse we're\Njust getting started by
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the end of this duel\Nyou'll be begging for mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then your old buddy mind\Nwill see what a pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,chunk you really are and\Nhopefully she'll realize
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,why she walked out at\Nyou in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so she can move on\Nalready watch it look mate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,all i'm watching out for\Nis myself And right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the best thing for me\Nis to get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.47,0:07:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as long as you're around, Mai's\Ngoing to be obsessed with dueling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your last duel, all\Nshe talks about is a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't let Mai put herself\Nin that kind of danger again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I got to you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Wheeler, I'm not such a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We both want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We want Mai to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really wanted Mai to be happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have brainwashed\Nher in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, she chose to join us! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Mai, and she never would\Nhave walked out on us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not unless someone messed with her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you ask me, this darts guy\Nis messing with all of your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That Orion card he gave\Nyou has evil magic in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And it makes everyone\Nwho holds it go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are, then allow\Nme to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ori Kulkhouse car did more\Nfor mine than you ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She was weak, and it made her strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She was lost, and it showed her the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our family, Miss Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, and remember the\NAurichalcos is always with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got what you've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I appreciate you taking me here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't think this means\NI owe you anything. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I do things my way, and I have no interest\Nin being part of some team, Valon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I already made that mistake once,\Nand you know where it got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are exactly the same, Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both loners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to admit,\Nsometimes it's not all that fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the long face, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You just accomplished your first\Nmission with flying colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But defeating Pegasus\Nmeant nothing to me. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one person out\Nthere I need to take apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and that chump's Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the sight of\Nyou, and neither can I, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So I plan to take you down for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're out of the picture, she can\Nmove on to bigger and much better things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Like teaming up with me and leaving\Nbehind her past once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai would never want to get rid of\Nme after what we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up off the floor, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And quit all your crying already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid thing won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't go blowing your nose in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, good luck out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the card I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai has nothing in common with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So she may be a little\Nrough around the edges,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and she can't have an attitude\Nevery once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But she'd never join up\Nwith a bunch of lowlives
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,who have some crazy plan\Nto take over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you guys did to her, I'm\Ngonna undo as soon as I win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.59,0:11:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't we move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed my battle warrior so\NI can summon Jinzo to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, Detective, attack strength, 2400.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Special ability, destroys traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush his psychic arm ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating attack deflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I attacked your helmet,\Nnot that thing. No kidding,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but whenever a piece\Nof my armor is attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can redirect the blast\Nto another piece So,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can hide inside your tin can, but you\Ncan't destroy Jinzo. I have to disagree,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,my armor's full of surprises
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, we're goners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tobias, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.39,0:12:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one. Where were you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, we tried to lead those things away\NYeah, by running really far Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stick together
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you geeks think that just cuz I\Nhelped you fight off some holograms now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm part of your little pep squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you got the wrong idea
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, it's been a real blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber will you at least\Nhelp us to find Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your heads
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a simple way to find\Nthat loser if you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sweetheart Wait! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's dual disc is activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so we track down his location with\Nthe Kaiba Corp satellite system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to access your\Ncompany's tracking system!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can still hear us!\NWhatever. Just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I hacked into his system\Nonce, and I'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do if Rebecca can't\Ncrack the code and track down Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cross that bridge when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got to have a\Nlittle faith, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the fun continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Target identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Suggested offense, Burning Knuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack points just went up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess. Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,just like Buster Knuckle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,this card gets an extra 200 attack\Npoints for every armor monster in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's still weaker than my Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm attacking your Jinzo with\NBurning Knuckle. Cheerio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But your metal arm was no match for Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.21,0:15:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Jinzo's seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost almost all his points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning Knuckles got a nasty side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's destroyed, its attack points\Nget subtracted from your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but you still have to\Ngive up almost half your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,life points just to lower\Nmy monster's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He just took a really big risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy must have a lot\Nof faith in that armor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,of his to willingly let\Ngo of all those points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Either that or he's just really dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're\Nout of luck, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Rocket Warrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Warrior, attack his overboost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating attack deflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, there goes your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But my Rocket Warrior comes\Naway without a scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.31,0:16:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,because I was smart enough to\Nput him in invincible mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though you lowered\NJinzo's attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,he's still strong enough to\Ndestroy your jet gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My Jinso!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your special ability, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a little\Ntired of this, Robo-boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to admit, you're not\Nsuch a terrible duelist, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know they're around here somewhere,\Nand I have to stop that duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better not be too late,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm going to make Wheeler\Npay for what he did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never go back to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to destroy Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.27,0:17:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as he's locked away, I can put\Nmy past behind me once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That pathetic fool isn't going to\Nknow what hit him until it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:17:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, any luck in there, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've asked five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's working as fast as she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the one who\Ntold us to have faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get off my back, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's in trouble, and if we don't\Nmove fast, things could get even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys see that this whole\Nthing is my fault? No, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When Joey and I got separated from\Nyou guys, he told me about his plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and I should have talked\Nhim out of it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just figured it all\Nout. Figured what out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,why my teamed up with those low lives it's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,because i was a terrible\Nfriend i let her down
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that's crazy but it's\Ntrue darts may be the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,one that brainwashed\Nher but i'm the one that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,drove her away in the\Nfirst place now i gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,go and set things\Nstraight by finding these
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:19:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,guys and breaking that\Nspell but how oh man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,what was i thinking how could i let him do\Nthis joey's got a mind of his own tristan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.15,0:19:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,let's just hope he's using it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,time to crush your last monster i summoned
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,buster pile what's that\Na replacement arm exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Buster Pile, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Term identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Projectile blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your Buster Pile only has 500 points,\NI'll assume it's got a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very observant, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My Buster Pile automatically wipes out any\Nmonster it attacks, regardless of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, it takes away 500\Nof your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:20:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll end my turn with this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Data Brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll link it up with\Nmy Psychic Armor Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see what this can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His Armour cards have taken me apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like no matter what monster I play,\Nthis guy is able to blow it sky high.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.43,0:20:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you stand up to this guy!
